    "3522": {
      "sha256": "986c4a6e22764a442b4bee9b8e2d411af671fa2f15cd2b50ef5646fdc8514666",
      "strings": [
        "<col=ffffff>Inquisitor's armour:<br><br>Each individual piece of Inquisitor's armour boosts damage and accuracy when using the crush attack style. <br><br>Current bonus: ",
        "%<br>",
        "<br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Amulet of air:</col><br><br>",
        "You have the Amulet of air equipped. Your air spells' max hit is increased by 2.<br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Amulet of water:</col><br><br>",
        "You have the Amulet of water equipped. Your water spells' max hit is increased by 2.<br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Amulet of earth:</col><br><br>",
        "You have the Amulet of earth equipped. Your earth spells' max hit is increased by 2.<br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Amulet of fire:</col><br><br>",
        "You have the Amulet of fire equipped. Your fire spells' max hit is increased by 2.<br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Elemental amulet:</col><br><br>",
        "You have the Elemental amulet equipped. Your air, water, earth and fire spells' max hit is increased by 2.<br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Swampbark Armour: <br><br>When wearing the Swampbark Helm, Body, or Legs, the duration of Bind, Snare and Entangle spells is increased by 1.2 seconds.<br>This is cumulative for each piece worn.</col><br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Bloodbark Armour: <br><br>When wearing a piece of Bloodbark armour, the amount of health restored by Blood spells is increased by 2.0%.<br>This is cumulative for each piece worn.</col><br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Zealot's prayer robes:<br><br>When wearing a piece of the Zealot's prayer robes, you have a 1.25% chance of saving ensouled heads when reanimating them, bones when burying or offering them, and bonemeal & slime at the Ectofuntus. This works alongside the Wilderness altar's bone saving effect.<br>This is cumulative for each piece worn.</col><br><br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Graceful Outfit:<br><br>The Graceful Outfit increases your run restoration rate.<br>",
        "Graceful Hood:  +3%<br>",
        "Graceful Torso:  +4%<br>",
        "Graceful Legs:  +4%<br>",
        "Graceful Gloves:  +3%<br>",
        "Graceful Boots:  +3%<br>",
        "Graceful Cape:  +3%<br>",
        "<br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Ranged Crystal Weaponry Accuracy Bonus:</col><br><br>",
        "Crystal Helm: +5%<br>",
        "Crystal Body:  +15%<br>",
        "Crystal Legs:  +10%<br>",
        "<br><col=ffffff>Ranged Crystal Weaponry Damage Bonus:</col><br><br>",
        "Crystal Helm: +2.5%<br>",
        "Crystal Body:  +7.5%<br>",
        "Crystal Legs:  +5%<br>",
        "<br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Zaryte Crossbow:</col><br><br>",
        "You have the Zaryte Crossbow equipped. Special bolt effects are increased by 10%.<br>",
        "<br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Keris Partisan of the Sun:</col><br><br>",
        "While within the Tombs of Amascut:<br><br>- You have 25% increased accuracy against creatures below 25% health<br><br>- Killing a creature with the partisan restores ",
        " hitpoints at the cost of ",
        " prayer points.<br>    - This effect can overheal up to 20% above your hitpoints.<br>",
        "<br>",
        "<col=ffffff>Dizana's Sunfire:</col><br><br>",
        "Dizana's Quiver ranged attack is increased by 10 and ranged strength is increased by 1.<br><col=ffffff>Only applies when using arrows and bolts.<br>",
        "<br>",
